 "一句话": "涨停59退潮:机器人缩圈秦安5板独苗,百花7板断板,温度40.1偏冷暴跌-28.4,总裁决B防守",
 "ticker": "<div class=\"ticker\"><div class=\"in\"><div class=\"grp\"><span>量能 <b class=\"a\">2.55万亿</b></span><span>涨停 <b class=\"u\">59</b> / 跌停 <b class=\"d\">4</b></span><span>炸板 <b>36</b>·炸板率 <b>37.9%</b></span><span>最高 <b class=\"u\">5板</b>(秦安股份)</span><span>情绪温度 <b>40.1</b>(偏冷)</span><span>回封 <b>25</b>·二板加 <b>22</b></span></div><div class=\"grp\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>量能 <b class=\"a\">2.55万亿</b></span><span>涨停 <b class=\"u\">59</b> / 跌停 <b class=\"d\">4</b></span><span>炸板 <b>36</b>·炸板率 <b>37.9%</b></span><span>最高 <b class=\"u\">5板</b>(秦安股份)</span><span>情绪温度 <b>40.1</b>(偏冷)</span><span>回封 <b>25</b>·二板加 <b>22</b></span></div></div></div>",
